# Patterns to ignore when building — these add noise without value to a
# containerised deploy. Production builds run from a clean git checkout
# anyway, so this is mostly belt-and-suspenders for `docker build .`.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.venv
**/venv
.git
.github
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov
.idea
.vscode
*.egg-info
build
dist
docs
tests
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.tox
.nox
.mypy_cache
.DS_Store
*.swp